\label{sec:b-precision-anchors}

T1 remeasures recall-0.97 anchors in one session with E1 pools. Twelve pairs per OpenAI dataset bracket baselines with two five-round JHQ repeats; QPS combines medians geometrically. Mean FP32/TF32 ratios are 0.956/0.964, changing add/query arithmetic on TF32-trained caches.

